# The Set page's default quantize at 70 %, then SHIFT (SEL) + white key 16
# three times: the focused clip's quantize goes 0, 70, 100 and back to 0.
--button 0.05:SEQ
--button 0.10:SEL:0.05
--key 0.12:7:100:0.01
--turn 0.20:KNOB3:7
--button 0.30:SEQ
--button 0.40:SEL:0.5
--key 0.45:26:100:0.01
--key 0.55:26:100:0.01
--key 0.65:26:100:0.01
--button 1.00:PLAY/STOP
